<title>UK: UK gilt auction announcement -- full details.</title>
<headline>UK gilt auction announcement -- full details.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Bank of England</p>
<p>ISSUER: H.M. Treasury</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 3.0 billion stg</p>
<p>COUPON: 8.0 percent</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2021</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: September 25</p>
<p>The stock will be fully paid and fungible with stock already in issue and will be strippable when strips facilities are introduced, the Bank said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
